The new record helps trace who kept the bone. It does not verify every link in its history or amount to a bishop's approval.

C1045 | divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7/tile/reader-caption/evidence-not-consensus/label; divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7/wonder italic caption/plain-divinity-evidence-not-consensus/item.label
